` has been generated, which again leads me to think it might be an issue with the custom box itself.\n\nCheers!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/comments/3138932267/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"taru-garg-hashicorp","id":199579441,"node_id":"U_kgDOC-VXMQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199579441?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taru-garg-hashicorp","html_url":"https://github.com/taru-garg-hashicorp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taru-garg-hashicorp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taru-garg-hashicorp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taru-garg-hashicorp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taru-garg-hashicorp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taru-garg-hashicorp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taru-garg-hashicorp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taru-garg-hashicorp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taru-garg-hashicorp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taru-garg-hashicorp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":18913893000,"node_id":"MEE_lADOAAdaUM7DeTCmzwAAAARnWxqI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/events/18913893000","actor":{"login":"Stromweld","id":3476391,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NzYzOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3476391?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stromweld","html_url":"https://github.com/Stromweld","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stromweld/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stromweld/following{/other